      {
        "id": "galatians-1-6-9",
        "label": "Galatians 1:6–9",
        "context": "Paul tells the Galatians to evaluate even impressive messengers by the gospel already preached. This supplies a test; a claimed contradiction must still be demonstrated.",
        "verses": [
          {
            "number": 6,
            "text": "I marvel that ye are so soon removed from him that called you into the grace of Christ unto another gospel:"
